WEBVTT

00:14.680 --> 00:20.190
<b>Recommended: Mango Parfait</b>

00:20.400 --> 00:24.980
<b>Maison des Fruits</b>

00:39.500 --> 00:40.790
<b>Good morning!</b>

00:42.210 --> 00:45.000
<b>- Morning.
- Morning. Is that homework?</b>

00:45.130 --> 00:48.340
<b>No, I'm prepping.
I'm not good with world history.</b>

00:48.470 --> 00:50.680
<b>I can relate to that.</b>

00:52.590 --> 00:55.100
<b>Miyako Fuji shared a health update</b>

00:53.760 --> 00:55.100
<b>It's from Miyako.</b>

00:55.390 --> 00:58.850
<b>- She's running again.
- She's already reached 10,000 steps?!</b>

00:58.980 --> 01:00.940
<b>Being in shape is good, but...</b>

01:01.060 --> 01:04.400
<b>She doesn't have to
condemn herself like that.</b>

01:06.190 --> 01:08.820
<b>Steps: 10,000
Walking + Running: 6.8 km
Floors: 1</b>

01:07.650 --> 01:10.490
<b>Maybe she just can't forgive herself.</b>

01:08.940 --> 01:10.490
<b>Here are today's results</b>

01:12.570 --> 01:17.830
<b>I can understand how running might help
take her mind off things.</b>

01:19.040 --> 01:20.330
<b>Ricchan...</b>

01:21.540 --> 01:26.800
<b>For me, that's playing the guitar
and eating dry-aged beef.</b>

01:27.710 --> 01:29.340
<b>Dry-aged beef, huh.</b>

01:29.460 --> 01:33.390
<b>The dense lean meat bursts
with rich, full-bodied umami.</b>

01:33.510 --> 01:34.300
<b>Right, umami.</b>

01:34.430 --> 01:36.140
<b>- Morning!
- Morning.</b>

01:36.260 --> 01:37.850
<b>- Oh, morning!
- Good morning.</b>

01:37.970 --> 01:39.600
<b>You're making dinner plans already?</b>

01:39.730 --> 01:42.980
<b>You two have some serious guts.</b>

01:43.480 --> 01:44.520
<b>The video!</b>

01:45.400 --> 01:46.980
<b>Thanks for telling us.</b>

01:47.230 --> 01:49.440
<b>Don't mention it.</b>

01:51.400 --> 01:56.870
<b>I want to clear away
all the guilt you've been carrying</b>

01:59.950 --> 02:02.080
<b>What can I do?</b>

02:03.290 --> 02:05.630
<b>Ugh, it's so hard</b>

02:06.250 --> 02:07.380
<b>Singing Yuno-san-chan's song!</b>

02:06.340 --> 02:07.380
<b>No...</b>

02:08.920 --> 02:12.420
<b>What do I want to do?</b>

02:22.100 --> 02:26.560
<i>Ready set and find out ready set and find out
it's only one newtype</i>

02:27.770 --> 02:32.400
<i>The story always revolves around us</i>

02:32.530 --> 02:37.320
<i>That may be a given But let me repeat it</i>

02:37.450 --> 02:42.500
<i>Can you read the guidelines?
No matter how carefully we write them</i>

02:42.620 --> 02:47.500
<i>Why does something always get in the way?
Still, we'll make it roar!</i>

02:47.630 --> 02:51.460
<i>In a heartbeat, like an overdrive</i>

02:51.590 --> 02:58.140
<i>We yearn to distort the world we see</i>

02:58.260 --> 03:03.020
<i>Seeing too clearly makes innocence
seem ridiculous, what a joke!</i>

03:03.180 --> 03:07.980
<i>Even vain attempts at being brave
Will be rewarded when the time comes</i>

03:08.110 --> 03:12.070
<i>This is the plot of our survival</i>

03:12.190 --> 03:17.530
<i>Rewriting the tale
Shedding absurd tears, the newtype way</i>

03:17.660 --> 03:22.410
<i>We can go anywhere, we can, so don't stop now</i>

03:22.540 --> 03:26.750
<i>Not an anime, not real either,
let's make our own category</i>

03:26.870 --> 03:30.000
<i>We've grown tired
of this complicated, dull world!</i>

03:30.130 --> 03:33.550
<i>Leave it to us, we'll write our own dreams</i>

03:33.670 --> 03:36.840
<i>Ready set and find out ready set and find out
it's only one newtype, our choice</i>

03:36.970 --> 03:38.590
<i>Following the steady beat</i>

03:38.720 --> 03:43.430
<i>Ready set and find out ready set and find out
it's only one newtype</i>

03:49.230 --> 03:50.690
<b>Warning</b>

03:54.530 --> 03:58.530
<b>What are we going to do?
Manager-san is totally pissed!</b>

03:58.660 --> 03:59.360
<b>She is?</b>

03:59.530 --> 04:02.160
<b>Maybe she thought that video was real!</b>

04:00.660 --> 04:01.620
<b>Hi.</b>

04:01.740 --> 04:03.080
<b>Hello.</b>

04:02.280 --> 04:04.910
<b>She's finally had it with all our issues</b>

04:03.290 --> 04:04.370
<b>What's happening?</b>

04:05.200 --> 04:07.250
<b>and her face is twitching...</b>

04:07.370 --> 04:08.710
<b>Here I am!</b>

04:08.830 --> 04:10.250
<b>Give me that.</b>

04:12.420 --> 04:16.130
<b>Sorry, guys.
I've been a little cranky lately.</b>

04:17.670 --> 04:20.390
<b>Regarding that video post
on social media...</b>

04:20.640 --> 04:24.060
<b>Or rather, that malicious fake video,</b>

04:24.180 --> 04:26.220
<b>I've filed a disclosure request.</b>

04:27.100 --> 04:31.310
<b>A disclosure request?!</b>

04:29.060 --> 04:31.400
<b>I wish we could've done it sooner.</b>

04:31.520 --> 04:35.110
<b>Yes, after everything they've done,
enough is enough.</b>

04:36.280 --> 04:39.240
<b>They dared lay a hand
on my precious kids.</b>

04:39.360 --> 04:41.450
<b>I'll make them regret it.</b>

04:41.870 --> 04:44.530
<b>- Nakamachi-san, Fuji-san...
- Yes?</b>

04:44.870 --> 04:48.290
<b>Just hang in there
a little longer, okay?</b>

04:51.000 --> 04:53.170
<b>I'm not afraid anymore!</b>

04:54.130 --> 04:55.710
<b>That's great, but...</b>

05:00.630 --> 05:05.140
<b>Uh... I have something I want to say.</b>

05:06.720 --> 05:09.390
<b>I'm going to speak with my music.</b>

05:11.650 --> 05:13.400
<b>For the longest time...</b>

05:14.150 --> 05:18.490
<b>I've wanted to talk to everyone
and share the things I love most.</b>

05:19.740 --> 05:21.400
<b>I'm going to do a live show.</b>

05:22.070 --> 05:23.990
<b>I totally agree!</b>

05:24.120 --> 05:25.740
<b>If something happens...</b>

05:26.370 --> 05:30.830
<b>It might be misunderstood,
but staying silent won't help.</b>

05:32.370 --> 05:33.580
<b>I'm going to sing.</b>

05:33.750 --> 05:37.500
<b>Me too!</b>

05:34.250 --> 05:38.920
<b>I want to show my true self too,
not the version someone else created.</b>

05:39.050 --> 05:40.720
<b>We can already see it.</b>

05:45.350 --> 05:47.640
<b>Understood. Please count me in.</b>

05:49.640 --> 05:51.270
<b>Manager-san?</b>

05:54.860 --> 05:58.940
<b>It's the first time the whole band
has agreed on something.</b>

06:00.820 --> 06:02.780
<b>I'm all for it!</b>

06:03.030 --> 06:03.820
<b>Then...</b>

06:03.950 --> 06:07.030
<b>I could clearly see
how determined you all are.</b>

06:07.160 --> 06:09.080
<b>Let's perform a live show.</b>

06:09.950 --> 06:11.120
<b>Yay!</b>

06:11.500 --> 06:12.870
<b>What songs?</b>

06:13.040 --> 06:15.670
<b>The song we made on the beach!</b>

06:15.790 --> 06:18.040
<b>I guess that one feels like us.</b>

06:18.170 --> 06:20.130
<b>And...</b>

06:20.670 --> 06:24.300
<b>I want to put my feelings
about the past and the future</b>

06:24.430 --> 06:27.050
<b>into the lyrics... I think.</b>

06:28.600 --> 06:30.100
<b>Great idea!</b>

06:30.220 --> 06:33.560
<b>I'm not one to talk,
but will you be okay?</b>

06:34.020 --> 06:38.190
<b>Writing lyrics is like composing.
It means facing yourself.</b>

06:38.360 --> 06:39.820
<b>You're right.</b>

06:39.940 --> 06:41.900
<b>That collaboration was a bit intense.</b>

06:42.030 --> 06:43.240
<b>Explains the depressing posts.</b>

06:43.360 --> 06:44.490
<b>Don't remind me.</b>

06:46.450 --> 06:49.410
<b>I've already made peace
with my feelings.</b>

06:49.780 --> 06:50.990
<b>Make peace...</b>

06:52.540 --> 06:53.750
<b>What do you mean?</b>

06:54.160 --> 06:56.710
<b>I mean, it's nothing special.</b>

06:56.830 --> 07:00.300
<b>I met up with an old friend,
and we had fun.</b>

07:01.670 --> 07:02.460
<b>What?</b>

07:02.590 --> 07:06.590
<b>You're not a mole.
You're the real Yuno-chan that talks.</b>

07:06.720 --> 07:10.390
<b>Shut up. I'm talking to Nakamachi-san.</b>

07:11.810 --> 07:13.390
<b>I'm all right now.</b>

07:13.850 --> 07:17.400
<b>The old me would never
have been able to do this,</b>

07:17.520 --> 07:19.560
<b>but I feel like I can now.</b>

07:19.860 --> 07:20.820
<b>Arale-chan.</b>

07:20.940 --> 07:24.240
<b>That's the Arale Nakamachi
I believed in.</b>

07:26.360 --> 07:27.860
<b>Aww, stop it.</b>

07:28.320 --> 07:31.700
<b>The public is still
pretty critical, though.</b>

07:32.370 --> 07:33.910
<b>We can do it together.</b>

07:35.000 --> 07:38.920
<b>I can't tell you how much
it means to hear you say that.</b>

07:39.040 --> 07:42.960
<b>Now then, let's get ready for the show.
Your hands, please.</b>

07:43.630 --> 07:45.630
<b>Huh? What?</b>

07:55.180 --> 07:58.560
<b>Now let's try solving a problem
using this formula.</b>

08:10.530 --> 08:12.870
<b>"I never thought I could be like this"</b>

08:13.410 --> 08:15.790
<b>"when we first met."</b>

08:16.960 --> 08:19.620
<b>"That's my line."</b>

08:21.000 --> 08:23.550
<b>"If this meeting is fate..."</b>

08:24.880 --> 08:26.720
<b>"I hope it continues."</b>

08:31.340 --> 08:32.680
<b>Anpan</b>

08:34.890 --> 08:36.640
<b>The bakery returns!</b>

08:36.770 --> 08:38.440
<b>It's the third Magilulu collaboration?</b>

08:38.560 --> 08:41.150
<b>Exactly! It's already started.</b>

08:41.270 --> 08:42.650
<b>Collect 100 stickers,</b>

08:42.770 --> 08:47.650
<b>and you get a figure of the most
popular end screen card.</b>

08:45.730 --> 08:47.650
<b>- "Is it noon already?"
- That's right!</b>

08:47.940 --> 08:49.780
<b>It's lunchtime!</b>

08:49.900 --> 08:51.910
<b>What are you having?</b>

08:52.030 --> 08:54.160
<b>"Nothing. I'll fall asleep if I eat."</b>

08:54.280 --> 08:57.040
<b>Aw, come on. Let's eat.</b>

08:57.160 --> 08:59.750
<b>You'll be more productive if you eat.</b>

09:01.250 --> 09:03.420
<b>Yuno-san-chan must be really busy.</b>

09:03.540 --> 09:05.210
<b>Especially right now.</b>

09:05.340 --> 09:07.800
<b>We're rooting for you, Yuno-san-chan!</b>

09:10.340 --> 09:11.130
<b>Oh?</b>

09:11.590 --> 09:14.970
<b>Aren't you taking part
in the Magilulu collaboration?</b>

09:15.100 --> 09:19.560
<b>No, I just forgot. So, I'll have
nothing but bread starting tomorrow.</b>

09:20.850 --> 09:22.850
<b>Let's do our best.</b>

09:22.980 --> 09:24.480
<b>Ricchan, it's today!</b>

09:24.610 --> 09:25.570
<b>Yes.</b>

09:26.650 --> 09:29.820
<b>Ricchan and I
have been practicing guitar together.</b>

09:29.940 --> 09:32.450
<b>Really?! How's that going?</b>

09:33.530 --> 09:35.530
<b>Like the music comes out on its own?</b>

09:35.660 --> 09:36.490
<b>"On its own"?</b>

09:36.870 --> 09:39.620
<b>The moment we play,
we feed off each other.</b>

09:39.750 --> 09:42.960
<b>My arms would be booming.</b>

09:43.080 --> 09:45.540
<b>- We've got good chemistry.
- Hehe.</b>

09:45.670 --> 09:48.510
<b>Miyako-san, your keyboard
is coming together too.</b>

09:50.300 --> 09:51.800
<b>You think so?</b>

09:52.260 --> 09:54.010
<b>I think it's really good.</b>

09:54.140 --> 09:55.300
<b>I'm glad.</b>

09:55.550 --> 09:58.890
<b>Imagining your voice while I played</b>

09:59.020 --> 10:01.980
<b>really helped my fingers
do what I wanted.</b>

10:04.440 --> 10:06.900
<b>I'll sing for you anytime!</b>

10:07.020 --> 10:07.940
<b>In a world...</b>

10:08.070 --> 10:11.190
<b>No! That's for the live show!</b>

10:11.320 --> 10:13.070
<b>Anyone could be listening.</b>

10:13.360 --> 10:16.700
<b>"I'm working with the manager
on the equipment."</b>

10:16.830 --> 10:17.780
<b>For the show!</b>

10:18.870 --> 10:22.910
<b>Much appreciated, Yuno-san-chan.
Big respect to manager-san!</b>

10:23.040 --> 10:26.040
<b>Oh, right.
Who wants to check out the venue?</b>

10:26.170 --> 10:26.960
<b>I'll go.</b>

10:27.170 --> 10:30.550
<b>Okay. So Nono-chan-san and Miyako-san...</b>

10:30.670 --> 10:32.840
<b>Power punch!</b>

10:32.970 --> 10:34.380
<b>No punching.</b>

10:34.510 --> 10:35.930
<b>It's the one from the aquarium.</b>

10:36.340 --> 10:39.680
<b>It's Tuna... Tuna... Una-kun!</b>

10:40.010 --> 10:41.390
<b>Una-kun!</b>

10:41.770 --> 10:44.520
<b>Will you come with us
to the venue, Yuno-san?</b>

10:45.100 --> 10:46.520
<b>"I'll leave it to you."</b>

10:46.650 --> 10:47.860
<b>Got it.</b>

10:47.980 --> 10:49.650
<b>What about you, Miyako-san?</b>

10:49.770 --> 10:51.280
<b>I also have some plans.</b>

10:51.400 --> 10:53.150
<b>A deadline, right?</b>

10:53.280 --> 10:53.950
<b>No...</b>

10:55.660 --> 10:58.200
<b>In the recent Chupa-Satu,</b>

10:58.530 --> 11:03.910
<b>I realized Sachi had always understood
the feelings behind Chupa's words.</b>

11:04.370 --> 11:05.670
<b>It just...</b>

11:06.290 --> 11:09.130
<b>It gave me this tight feeling
in my chest,</b>

11:09.250 --> 11:13.090
<b>like your old standalone stories,
and I really loved it.</b>

11:13.550 --> 11:15.090
<b>My standalones...</b>

11:16.970 --> 11:20.640
<b>It was before the series,
so I didn't expect to read it,</b>

11:21.140 --> 11:23.180
<b>but it was included.</b>

11:23.770 --> 11:27.440
<b>How embarrassing!
I'm still hung up on it!</b>

11:27.600 --> 11:29.810
<b>I go on about guilt and atonement,</b>

11:29.940 --> 11:33.320
<b>but I'm still unconsciously
clinging to the past.</b>

11:30.650 --> 11:33.280
<b>If this meeting is destiny...</b>

11:33.740 --> 11:35.400
<b>So, so embarrassing...</b>

11:35.530 --> 11:40.830
<b>It's Chupa and Satu, so the relationship
is different from the standalones,</b>

11:41.780 --> 11:44.540
<b>but I just like them
purely as characters.</b>

11:48.170 --> 11:49.580
<b>Well...</b>

11:49.710 --> 11:51.460
<b>Thank you.</b>

11:53.590 --> 11:57.470
<b>I really appreciate
you sharing your thoughts with me.</b>

11:59.220 --> 12:02.260
<b>No, no, it's really nothing.</b>

12:02.390 --> 12:03.720
<b>Here, Miyako-san.</b>

12:04.770 --> 12:08.100
<b>Giant sweet bean jelly</b>

12:06.270 --> 12:08.100
<b>"Huh? A wheel stopper?"</b>

12:08.560 --> 12:09.480
<b>What's this?</b>

12:09.600 --> 12:13.610
<b>A little sugar for work.
Eat it when you need a boost.</b>

12:14.400 --> 12:15.440
<b>Thank you...</b>

12:15.570 --> 12:16.990
<b>I'll help you carry it.</b>

12:17.110 --> 12:18.910
<b>Me too!</b>

12:23.160 --> 12:25.700
<b>- Oh, I'm sorry.
- It's fine.</b>

12:25.830 --> 12:27.870
<b>You never forget to turn it off.</b>

12:28.120 --> 12:31.830
<b>Yeah, we're always the ones
who get scolded for that.</b>

12:30.290 --> 12:32.250
<b>Miyako Fuji:
Let's meet up.
I'll wait for you at that shop</b>

12:33.460 --> 12:34.750
<b>Are you okay, Viola-chan?</b>

12:35.000 --> 12:37.260
<b>- Is it an emergency?
- Not at all.</b>

12:37.720 --> 12:40.890
<b>I was told to put away
my toys when I'm finished.</b>

12:41.220 --> 12:43.680
<b>Are you playing with toys?</b>

12:43.810 --> 12:47.480
<b>No, it's not a toy,
but my mom keeps saying it is.</b>

12:47.600 --> 12:49.390
<b>That's so cute.</b>

13:24.550 --> 13:27.060
<b>Miyako, it's time.</b>

13:37.030 --> 13:38.690
<b>If you only wait...</b>

13:39.740 --> 13:41.990
<b>you will never break your fate.</b>

13:42.740 --> 13:45.490
<b>If someone holds half of my fate, I will make it happen
To question our fate</b>

13:45.620 --> 13:47.330
<b>Let's move time forward</b>

13:48.620 --> 13:49.870
<b>Viola-san.</b>

13:52.870 --> 13:54.830
<b>I've been waiting for you.</b>

13:56.500 --> 13:57.710
<b>Miyako-san.</b>

13:58.250 --> 14:01.420
<b>I'm sorry I didn't reply
to all your texts.</b>

14:01.550 --> 14:03.760
<b>Work has been so hectic lately.</b>

14:03.890 --> 14:05.470
<b>I know.</b>

14:06.680 --> 14:10.520
<b>You're in the middle
of a three-day interview</b>

14:10.640 --> 14:14.020
<b>or a documentary shoot at your agency.</b>

14:14.310 --> 14:17.730
<b>It's understandable
that you couldn't read my texts.</b>

14:18.150 --> 14:21.780
<b>So I waited for you
around the time you'd finish work</b>

14:21.900 --> 14:25.700
<b>somewhere along your way home.</b>

14:32.000 --> 14:34.040
<b>Shall we go someplace else?</b>

14:57.520 --> 15:00.730
<b>Miyako-san, I have a curfew, so...</b>

15:00.860 --> 15:02.070
<b>Viola-san.</b>

15:04.320 --> 15:08.410
<b>I was happy I met you.</b>

15:10.370 --> 15:12.790
<b>Why say it like it's in the past?</b>

15:13.250 --> 15:15.210
<b>I want it to be in the past.</b>

15:17.000 --> 15:20.550
<b>The dream you showed me was a happy one.</b>

15:21.750 --> 15:26.550
<b>I still believe that the brilliance
I saw back then was real.</b>

15:27.550 --> 15:30.050
<b>I'm really grateful for that.</b>

15:32.720 --> 15:36.890
<b>What you felt when reading my work</b>

15:37.480 --> 15:38.690
<b>wasn't wrong.</b>

15:39.310 --> 15:41.440
<b>Even if it was a lie.</b>

15:41.570 --> 15:43.440
<b>- It wasn't a lie...
- I...</b>

15:44.360 --> 15:47.780
<b>I thought I could share
my soul with you.</b>

15:48.490 --> 15:50.450
<b>You despise people who shine.</b>

15:51.160 --> 15:53.080
<b>"I never had it to begin with."</b>

15:53.620 --> 15:58.250
<b>"No matter how hard I try,
I'll never have that shining radiance."</b>

16:02.170 --> 16:05.670
<b>Those were my true feelings.</b>

16:06.920 --> 16:10.090
<b>I believe that as well.</b>

16:10.220 --> 16:11.260
<b>Then...</b>

16:11.390 --> 16:15.730
<b>I think we can understand
each other at the deepest level.</b>

16:17.230 --> 16:20.100
<b>Yes, that's also true.</b>

16:20.520 --> 16:23.570
<b>If only we had met differently...</b>

16:24.150 --> 16:26.860
<b>There was no other way for us to meet.</b>

16:31.450 --> 16:33.990
<b>I don't want to let you go.</b>

16:35.200 --> 16:36.750
<b>Are you leaving me?</b>

16:37.000 --> 16:40.500
<b>Then why did you
have to post that... video.</b>

16:40.630 --> 16:42.340
<b>It was necessary.</b>

16:44.340 --> 16:48.220
<b>It was a defense against
a violently dazzling brilliance.</b>

16:48.670 --> 16:50.380
<b>You get it, don't you?</b>

16:50.510 --> 16:55.560
<b>It's what allows me to shine
when faced with something real.</b>

16:59.020 --> 17:02.100
<b>You already shine brightly enough.</b>

17:02.860 --> 17:07.150
<b>The more I was drawn to you
and looked deeper, the more I felt it.</b>

17:07.610 --> 17:11.530
<b>A project that fully showcased
the La La La La Girls.</b>

17:11.660 --> 17:13.410
<b>A video-focused activity.</b>

17:13.530 --> 17:17.700
<b>In Fairy Bouquet,
you valued each member's individuality</b>

17:17.830 --> 17:22.460
<b>and gave them freedom and centered
promotion around individual streams.</b>

17:22.580 --> 17:25.710
<b>You controlled the rarity
of exposure in events.</b>

17:26.090 --> 17:27.380
<b>However,</b>

17:28.010 --> 17:32.090
<b>this time, thanks to that member's
free use of social media</b>

17:28.090 --> 17:30.300
<b>Work's done! Lots to do tomorrow</b>

17:30.420 --> 17:32.800
<b>Interview at the office from 5 PM</b>

17:32.220 --> 17:35.010
<b>I was able to wait for you.</b>

17:32.930 --> 17:35.010
<b>I might do a livestream later</b>

17:37.850 --> 17:39.890
<b>I am empty inside.</b>

17:40.890 --> 17:46.320
<b>I have no confidence, so I don't even
have the words to describe who I am.</b>

17:46.440 --> 17:49.280
<b>I have no confidence in my work either,</b>

17:49.860 --> 17:52.780
<b>even though I pour my soul into it.</b>

17:53.530 --> 17:58.490
<b>So I end up searching through the words
overflowing on social media,</b>

17:58.870 --> 18:01.750
<b>getting swept up in waves of emotion.</b>

18:02.370 --> 18:06.340
<b>You gave me everything I wanted.</b>

18:06.460 --> 18:11.550
<b>Confidence, certainty, and even
a momentary, shining Yako Fujimi.</b>

18:12.340 --> 18:15.890
<b>But I'm too clumsy,</b>

18:16.220 --> 18:21.430
<b>so once my emptiness is filled,
I lose sight of everything around me.</b>

18:21.560 --> 18:23.850
<b>Being absorbed is wonderful.</b>

18:23.980 --> 18:24.650
<b>No.</b>

18:25.520 --> 18:27.940
<b>It becomes the only thing I can do.</b>

18:28.070 --> 18:31.400
<b>I keep ruminating
over what I've experienced.</b>

18:32.650 --> 18:35.410
<b>That's when I started to think.</b>

18:35.530 --> 18:39.200
<b>I asked myself what my core was,</b>

18:41.120 --> 18:44.420
<b>and I answered
that it was creative work.</b>

18:44.920 --> 18:47.170
<b>I love to draw.</b>

18:47.540 --> 18:50.880
<b>It's the only thing in my life
I know for certain.</b>

18:51.010 --> 18:54.800
<b>I love to write stories.
That's the only truth.</b>

18:55.430 --> 18:57.180
<b>I enjoy working alone,</b>

18:57.890 --> 19:03.390
<b>but creating songs with MewType
was more fun than I ever imagined.</b>

19:03.520 --> 19:07.310
<b>When I found a new side of myself
in that feeling,</b>

19:07.480 --> 19:11.860
<b>a new angle for a story came to mind.</b>

19:13.530 --> 19:18.910
<b>At the same time, I ended up projecting
my experience with you into my work.</b>

19:19.200 --> 19:22.700
<b>This is bad. Really bad.</b>

19:23.370 --> 19:28.460
<b>Like I said, once I'm satisfied,
I start ruminating on the same things.</b>

19:28.580 --> 19:33.210
<b>As a creator, I can't let that be.
Do you understand?</b>

19:33.840 --> 19:34.670
<b>No.</b>

19:34.800 --> 19:38.840
<b>Don't you get it?!
Everything ends up being the same story!</b>

19:39.260 --> 19:43.180
<b>Didn't you understand
the soul of my work?</b>

19:43.310 --> 19:45.100
<b>Were you just pretending?</b>

19:46.640 --> 19:48.310
<b>You already know.</b>

19:50.610 --> 19:51.860
<b>We...</b>

19:52.440 --> 19:55.490
<b>can be better than anyone else.</b>

19:57.030 --> 19:58.240
<b>If we're together.</b>

19:59.410 --> 20:01.200
<b>That's...</b>

20:02.830 --> 20:09.130
<b>exactly what I mean by boring!</b>

20:17.760 --> 20:18.380
<b>I'm...</b>

20:18.840 --> 20:20.260
<b>going to become MewType!</b>

20:20.760 --> 20:24.310
<b>Our thoughts, lives,
and backgrounds are different,</b>

20:24.430 --> 20:27.730
<b>They're loud, annoying,
and way too pushy,</b>

20:27.850 --> 20:29.770
<b>but I'll take it all in!</b>

20:31.270 --> 20:35.610
<b>They're unbelievably exhausting
to be with, but that's fine!</b>

20:35.730 --> 20:38.030
<b>An empty person has their own way.</b>

20:38.400 --> 20:42.240
<b>I'll keep going through life
with chaotic people,</b>

20:42.370 --> 20:44.620
<b>unsettling myself along the way.</b>

20:44.740 --> 20:47.160
<b>Even hatred or sadness is fine.</b>

20:47.290 --> 20:50.880
<b>Why? Because it leads to creation.</b>

20:51.000 --> 20:53.250
<b>I won't love anyone anymore!</b>

20:53.590 --> 20:57.760
<b>I'll cast away all desires
and devote everything to creation.</b>

20:57.970 --> 20:59.840
<b>This is who I am.</b>

20:59.970 --> 21:04.220
<b>Miyako Fuji!</b>

21:04.510 --> 21:08.020
<b>Approach, Force, Fight, Presence...</b>

21:08.140 --> 21:12.020
<b>Unity, Formation, Intensity, Being...</b>

21:12.150 --> 21:16.360
<b>Ahead!</b>

21:20.490 --> 21:24.490
<b>Thank you for taking the time
to meet with me today.</b>

21:24.620 --> 21:27.700
<b>That's all I have to say. Thank you.</b>

21:37.920 --> 21:38.880
<b>I said it.</b>

21:39.840 --> 21:41.590
<b>I really said it.</b>

21:55.980 --> 22:03.700
<i>Why can birds fly through the sky?
Why are cats always asleep?</i>

22:03.820 --> 22:07.620
<i>How will you live today?</i>

22:07.740 --> 22:15.630
<i>All, all, all of it
Let's go search for it all</i>

22:19.670 --> 22:27.350
<i>Why does the morning sun kiss my skin?
Why does the night leave me feeling down?</i>

22:27.470 --> 22:35.020
<i>If only we could split our sorrows in half
Wouldn't that be great?</i>

22:35.810 --> 22:43.110
<i>Laughter and worry interweave
In a corner of this vast world</i>

22:43.700 --> 22:51.410
<i>Come with us
To uncover the wonders of the universe</i>

22:53.040 --> 23:00.750
<i>What stories shall we share today?
What melodies shall we sing?</i>

23:00.880 --> 23:04.680
<i>Even flowers as yet unseen</i>

23:04.800 --> 23:11.850
<i>All, all, all of it
Let's go search for it all</i>

23:12.680 --> 23:19.610
<i>All, all, all of it
Let's go search for it all</i>

23:25.400 --> 23:26.610
<b>It's finally here.</b>

23:26.740 --> 23:28.490
<b>- You nervous?
- Let's go.</b>

23:28.620 --> 23:30.410
<b>Don't worry. We're all here.</b>

23:30.530 --> 23:33.080
<b>Let's go talk a lot.</b>

23:33.200 --> 23:35.620
<b>Next episode, "Mugendai MewType."</b>

23:35.750 --> 23:39.790
<b>Yume Mita, let's go!</b>
